meta {
  name: Simplespace Put Member
  type: http
  seq: 152
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/xrpc/com.atproto.simplespace.putMember
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "space": "at://{{did}}/space/org.example.bucket/main",
    "did": "did:plc:memberaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
    "read": true,
    "write": true
  }
}

docs {
  Add a DID to a simplespace space's member list, or replace its read/write access — the
  host-internal list consulted under the "member-list" read policy (the read bit, at
  credential-mint time) and write policy (the write bit, on write notifications); it is not a
  synced protocol structure. The member is not notified; their PDS materializes a repo on first write.
  Idempotent.

  Membership management is a space-level "manage=update" operation; the caller must be the
  space's authority. Errors: 400 SpaceNotFound, 400 NotSpaceOwner, 403 InsufficientScope.
}
